BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  # The Fountain of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  In ancient times, two rivers flowed from separate mountains, each controlled by a guardian spi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    rit. The first spirit, sensing drought approaching, faced a choice: pour water downstream wh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ere it would triple in the valley below, or hoard it in her highland pools.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  She chose trust, releasing her waters. As promised, they multiplied threefold in the enchanted) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (     valley. The second guardian, now blessed with abundance, faced his own test: keep all the w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ater, or return some upstream to his sister spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  The wise guardian understood that seasons turn, roles reverse. He returned half of what he rec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    eived, knowing tomorrow he might be the one in need. Both spirits prospered-she retained mor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    e than she'd released, while he kept abundant stores.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  This cycle continued through many seasons. When either guardian grew greedy, keeping all or gi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    ving nothing, both rivers diminished. The valley's magic only worked when waters flowed both) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (     ways.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  The spirits learned: trust multiplies resources, but reciprocity sustains them. Generosity cre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ates abundance, yet wisdom requires balance. Neither extreme selfishness nor reckless giving) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     serves the whole.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  Thus the fountain of abundance flows only when both guardians remember: what we circulate retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    rns greater than what we hoard.) Tj ET
