BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  # The Fountain of Three Springs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  In ancient times, the Sky Keeper descended to a divided valley where two villages dwelled in i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    solation. Each day, She blessed one village with five golden seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  "Plant these in the Fountain of Three Springs," She whispered, "and they shall multiply threef) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    old. But the harvest belongs to your neighbor.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  The first village, fearful and suspicious, buried their seeds in the earth beneath their homes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    . They kept their five seeds safe, yet remained forever poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  But one season, a brave farmer named Dorian received the seeds. Remembering his grandmother's ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    wisdom-"abundance shared becomes abundance multiplied"-he carried all five to the fountain. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    The waters shimmered, and fifteen golden seeds bloomed, flowing to the neighboring village.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  The neighbors marveled at this gift. Their elder spoke: "Dorian trusted us with his fortune. L) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    et us honor this trust." They returned ten seeds to Dorian, keeping five for themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  Both villages prospered. Word spread, and soon all villages embraced the practice. Each planti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ng, each return, wove threads of trust stronger than iron chains.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  The Sky Keeper smiled: "When one dares to give freely, and others return generously, no one ne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ed live in scarcity. The fountain's magic lies not in the water, but in the hearts of those ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    who believe in each other.") Tj ET
