BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  One day, the Rain spoke: "River, I shall give you my waters, though I must let them go from my) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (     grasp." With trust, the Rain released its precious drops. As they fell, they multiplied thr) Tj ET
