BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      # The Fountain of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      In ancient times, two rivers flowed from separate mountains, each controlled by a guardian) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (         spirit. The first spirit, sensing drought approaching, faced a choice: pour water downs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        tream where it would triple in the valley below, or hoard it in her highland pools.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      She chose trust, releasing her waters. As promised, they multiplied threefold in the encha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        nted valley. The second guardian, now blessed with abundance, faced his own test: keep a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        ll the water, or return some upstream to his sister spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      The wise guardian understood that seasons turn, roles reverse. He returned half of what he) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (         received, knowing tomorrow he might be the one in need. Both spirits prospered-she reta) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        ined more than she'd released, while he kept abundant stores.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      This cycle continued through many seasons. When either guardian grew greedy, keeping all o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        r giving nothing, both rivers diminished. The valley's magic only worked when waters flo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        wed both ways.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      The spirits learned: trust multiplies resources, but reciprocity sustains them. Generosity) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (         creates abundance, yet wisdom requires balance. Neither extreme selfishness nor reckles) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        s giving serves the whole.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
