BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        r's wisdom-"abundance shared becomes abundance multiplied"-he carried all five to the fo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        untain. The waters shimmered, and fifteen golden seeds bloomed, flowing to the neighbori) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ng village.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      The neighbors marveled at this gift. Their elder spoke: "Dorian trusted us with his fortun) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        e. Let us honor this trust." They returned ten seeds to Dorian, keeping five for themsel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        ves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      Both villages prospered. Word spread, and soon all villages embraced the practice. Each pl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        anting, each return, wove threads of trust stronger than iron chains.) Tj ET
