BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      In ancient times, the Sky Keeper descended to a divided valley where two villages dwelled ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        in isolation. Each day, She blessed one village with five golden seeds.) Tj ET
