BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      In ancient times, two rivers flowed from separate mountains, each controlled by a guardian) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (         spirit. The first spirit, sensing drought approaching, faced a choice: pour water downs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        tream where it would triple in the valley below, or hoard it in her highland pools.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
