BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      When next the dawn came, it was Dorian who stood with five threads of starlight. Without h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        esitation, he cast four across the Mirror Lake, just as Hana had done. The threads multi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        plied to twelve in Hana's hands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      She smiled, recognizing the pattern. "He trusted me as I trusted him," she whispered. She ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        gathered eight threads and sent them dancing back across the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      The Lake itself began to glow brighter. The weavers had found the rhythm-not maximizing ea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        ch single exchange, but weaving a tapestry across time. Four sent, eight returned. Then ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        roles reversed: four sent, eight returned again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      Other lakes watched in wonder. Some weavers tried to keep more, breaking the pattern. Thei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        r lakes dimmed. Others gave everything, receiving nothing back. Their threads ran out.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      But Hana and Dorian's Mirror Lake blazed with light. They had learned that the magic wasn') Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        t in any single throw or return-it was in the matching of steps, the mirroring of trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (         Each gained four threads per cycle, not through calculation, but through harmony.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      "The Lake doesn't reward the greedy or the reckless," Hana realized. "It rewards those who) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (         dance the same dance together.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
