BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        ra and Aster, arrived from opposite banks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      Cyra cast three of her five stones first. The waters blessed them, and nine stones arrived) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (         at Aster's shore. Aster, grateful for this trust, returned six stones across the lake. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        Though the return did not triple, Cyra rejoiced-she had gained one stone, and both had l) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        earned the way of fair exchange.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      When the waters calmed, Aster faced the Mirror Lake and made a profound choice. She cast a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        ll five of her stones with complete faith. The lake transformed them into fifteen glitte) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        ring stones at Cyra's feet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      Cyra gazed at this ultimate trust. Aster had held nothing back, believing entirely in the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        sacred cycle. This demanded the highest honor. Cyra returned ten stones-double what Aste) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        r had risked. Both shores now held abundance: Aster received ten from her five, while Cy) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        ra kept five from nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      The Sky Spirit spoke: "See how trust magnifies trust? Reasonable faith earns fair return, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        but absolute faith deserves extraordinary honor. This is how prosperity flows eternal.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
