BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      As seasons turned, the Weaver encountered both generous and cautious partners. With the ge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        nerous, abundance flowed richly. With the cautious, prosperity came more modestly. But b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        oth partnerships succeeded because the foundation remained: steady trust freely offered,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (         genuine reciprocity honestly returned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      The elder Starweavers taught: "Send the same meaningful portion to each new companion. Let) Tj ET
