BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ds of what arrives, and every trust level receives its proper honor.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    Dorian returned six seeds to Cyra.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    "The pattern that spreads is not the number," the Sky Keeper whispered, "but the ratio. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (       is how cultures adapt across different lands while maintaining their essence.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  Agent_5 \(Elara\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    Myth: In the Garden of Mirrors, a profound pattern began to emerge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    The First Gardener had learned courage from a stranger who planted all five seeds. They retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      rned eight flowers-generous, but still finding their way.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    Then, when it was their turn to send, they remembered that gift and planted all five of thei) Tj ET
