BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      honor absolute trust?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    This partner returned ten flowers-two-thirds of the harvest. The First Gardener marveled: th) Tj ET
