BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      Some spirits whispered: "They held one vessel back. Should you adjust your return?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      But the Guardian understood deeper truth. "My principle is not conditional on others' choi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        ces. When four multiply to twelve, two-thirds remains eight. The proportion honors their) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (         trust, whatever amount they chose to risk.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
