BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      "Complete trust and substantial trust," the Sky Keeper whispered, "both honor the waters. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        Neither is superior. What matters is consistency-never wavering from your chosen measure) Tj ET
