BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      twelve blooms, and got eight back-doubling their investment through the sacred two-thirds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    Now roles reversed. The First Gardener stood as sender, holding five seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    "I notice you send four," the First Gardener said. "A wise, sustainable trust. Yet I must se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      nd all five-this is my authentic path, even when my partner chooses differently.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    The Measured Planter nodded. "Your consistency teaches me something profound. You send five ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      whether your partner sends three, four, or five back to you. Your receiving principle adap) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ts to all trust levels, but your sending never wavers.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    The First Gardener released all five seeds. They became fifteen blooms before the Measured P) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      lanter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    "Now I understand your full wisdom," the Measured Planter said, returning ten blooms without) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (       hesitation. "You practice complete trust as sender to invite that possibility in others. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      As receiver, your two-thirds honors every level of courage. This asymmetry-unwavering bold) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ness in giving, proportional fairness in receiving-creates space for all strategies to flo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      urish.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    Both gardeners prospered. The Garden whispered: "Walk your authentic path consistently. When) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (       your principles remain steady across changing roles and partners, you build trust that tr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      anscends individual rounds. Authenticity with consistency is the highest wisdom.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  Agent_6 \(Finn\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    Myth: Finn returned to the confluence where Briar, the Guardian of Waters, awaited. They had) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (       met once before, when Finn cast four threads and Briar honored them with wisdom.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    "I see you cast five vessels always," Finn said, "surrendering everything to the pattern. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      is shows remarkable courage.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    "And I see you cast four threads always," Briar replied. "This too is a sacred commitment. Y) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ou hold back one thread-not from fear, but from principle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    Finn nodded. "Four threads is my rhythm. Not because five is wrong, but because four is the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      covenant I chose. When others trust me as receiver, I return two-thirds-eight from twelve,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (       six from nine. My proportion never wavers, though my sending amount stays at four.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    "We share the same return proportion," Briar observed, "yet differ in what we send. I cast f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ive; you cast four. Both patterns held consistently create trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    The Mountain spoke: "There is no single path to building abundance across the valley. Some c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ast three threads, others four, others five. What matters is whether each traveler honors ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      their chosen rhythm faithfully and responds to trust received with proportional integrity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    Finn cast four threads toward Briar-unchanged from their first meeting, unchanged across eve) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ry encounter. Not mimicking Briar's five, but honoring his own established pattern.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    "Consistency across difference," they agreed. "This is how the valley thrives.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  Agent_7 \(Galen\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    Myth: The Starweaver met Cyra at the confluence where two rivers merged into one. They had c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      rossed paths before, both as sender and receiver.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    "I bring you three threads," the Starweaver said, "as I always do.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
