BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    Cyra smiled with recognition. "And I know this three. When I sent to Finn, I also brought th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ree. When you sent to me before, you brought three. We walk the same path as senders.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    The threads multiplied to nine in Cyra's hands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    "Does our matching pattern create special meaning?" the Starweaver wondered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    "Perhaps," Cyra reflected, "it shows that the same truth can be discovered independently. Yo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      u chose three through your journey. I chose three through mine. We weren't imitating-we we) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      re both finding the same balance between generosity and sustainability.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    "Yet even matching amounts would mean nothing," the Starweaver added, "without the sacred pr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      oportion of return. Three sent or four sent or five sent-all flourish only when met with g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      enuine reciprocity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    Cyra returned six threads from nine. "Two-thirds, as always. Not because you sent three, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (       because honest return is independent of the gift received.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    The Starweaver received eight total. "So we mirror each other's sending, but even more impor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      tantly, we mirror each other's covenant to honor trust proportionally.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    "The rivers merge," Cyra agreed, "because both carry the same waters of integrity.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  Agent_8 \(Hana\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    Myth: Elara returned to Hana's shore, once again casting all five threads with unwavering co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      urage. The fifteen threads manifested, and Hana's hands moved with practiced grace: ten th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      reads returned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    "You honor my complete trust perfectly," Elara observed. "But I've noticed-you send four thr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      eads when the roles reverse, not five like I do. Yet you always return two-thirds to anyon) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      e. How do these truths sit together?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    Hana traced patterns in the sand. "My receiving principle stands independent of my sending c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      hoice. When YOU send five, I return ten-two-thirds of fifteen. When ASTER sends five, I re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      turn ten. When someone sends three, I return six-still two-thirds. The proportion is sacre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      d, unchanging.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    "But," she continued, "my sending reflects my authentic courage: four threads. Not because I) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (       distrust others, but because this is my true measure of partnership. I don't claim to be ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      bolder than I am.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    Elara understood. "So you maintain two separate consistencies: one for receiving, one for se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      nding. Both are honest.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    "Exactly," Hana replied. "You inspire me with your complete vulnerability. I honor it fully ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      as receiver. But I don't pretend to mirror it as sender. This is integrity-letting each ro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      le express its own truth while maintaining the sacred return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    The shore blessed them both: different sendings, identical honoring, mutual flourishing thro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ugh authentic consistency.) Tj ET
